# the startup splash left alone (TUI-DESIGN-3 §3.4 / §3.5): no key — the wordmark ticks at 50 ms (≤ 15 frames in 700 ms) and settles by
# itself into the held mark with its caption `◆ <version>` (the round-3 settle sentinel); every frame after it carries the mark; the loop
# rests for 5.75 s after `splash:done`, so the 5 s after the settle write no frame (the frames between the caption frame and the echo of
# the marker key are counted by run-smoke.sh: 0); zero clears
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆(?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*\d+\.\d+\.\d+
mark settled
expect sess \$
sleep 5
mark quiet
send h
expect (?:›|>) (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*h
send \x03
expect Say hi
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
